     \[
     AC^2 = AB^2 + BD^2 - 2 \cdot AB \cdot BD \cdot \cos(\angle ABC)
     \]
   - Since $\angle ABC > \angle BCD$, we have $\cos(\angle ABC) < \cos(\angle BCD)$.

