     \[
     \text{C} = \frac{1}{2} \times \frac{1}{2.20 \times 10^3} = 0.125 \times 10^3 = 125 \text{ ft/s}
     \]

3. **Conclusion**:
   - The required current-frequency of the second antenna to achieve this matching condition is 125 ft/s.

